// title: Talk to a character
// about: Someone to meet, with a greeting and a few responses.
// kind: character
// question: name|Name|name|
// question: pronouns|Pronouns|choice:they,she,he,it|they
// question: place|Home place|location|
// question: greeting|Greeting|prose|Hello, stranger.
// question: response1|First response|prose|Ask about this place
// question: reply1|First reply|prose|There is much to discover.
// question: response2|Second response|prose|Ask about them
// question: reply2|Second reply|prose|Perhaps we will get to know each other.
// question: response3|Last response|prose|Say goodbye
== character {{id}}
name: {{name}}
pronouns: {{pronouns}}
lives at: {{place}}
values:
    met: flag
talk:
    ~ {{id}}.met = true
    {{greeting}}
    * {{response1}}
        {{reply1}}
        -> back
    * {{response2}}
        {{reply2}}
        -> back
    * {{response3}}
        -> end
